        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your enemies are full of hot air, so you make their lungs burn when they try to talk. The target takes 4d6 fire damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a failed save, the target also burns whenever they speak, causing them to take @Damage[@item.rank[fire]] damage whenever they use an action with the auditory trait or Cast a Spell, unless their spell is subtle.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The initial fire damage increases by 1d6, and the fire damage the target takes whenever they take an action with the auditory trait or Cast a Spell increases by 1.</p>"
